  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1 - PULL TODAY'S CANDIDATE COMPANIES\n\nRuns every weekday morning. Pulls a small batch from the source list and works through it one company at a time.",
        "height": 1000,
        "width": 700,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "85b16f01-a1e6-5b56-9eed-05d5f3d81bce",
      "name": "Section - 1 - PULL TODAY'S CANDIDATE COMPANIES",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2 - RESEARCH AND FIT-CHECK AGAINST YOUR CRITERIA\n\nClaude reads the company site and judges it against your written criteria. Anything it is not sure about gets rejected with the reason, not added.",
        "height": 1000,
        "width": 900,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "4c334a14-baa5-5794-8185-d19c8053c512",
      "name": "Section - 2 - RESEARCH AND FIT-CHECK AGAINST YOUR CRITERIA",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        860,
        -120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 3 - FIND AND VERIFY THE DECISION-MAKER\n\nHunter finds the right person by title, then verifies the address. Unverified emails never reach a campaign.",
        "height": 1000,
        "width": 700,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "31776bb8-bdaf-50d3-a67b-cdbdb6d76a79",
      "name": "Section - 3 - FIND AND VERIFY THE DECISION-MAKER",
